    "detailed_description": "Grav Factor is a built-for-VR game where you pilot a ship with 6DOF movement.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Built for VR, from day one. If you have VR motion controllers no other hardware is necessary!<br></li><li> Although it's built for VR motion controls, joysticks are supported!<br></li><li> Explore a dangerous underwater world<br></li><li> Accept a variety of missions to help or hinder humanity's remaining factions<br></li><li> Take on obstacle courses in each of the game's cities, testing your piloting skill<br></li><li> Collect new ships, weapons and upgrades as you progress through the game</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Grav Factor is a built-for-VR game where you pilot a ship with 6DOF movement.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Built for VR, from day one. If you have VR motion controllers no other hardware is necessary!<br></li><li> Although it's built for VR motion controls, joysticks are supported!<br></li><li> Explore a dangerous underwater world<br></li><li> Accept a variety of missions to help or hinder humanity's remaining factions<br></li><li> Take on obstacle courses in each of the game's cities, testing your piloting skill<br></li><li> Collect new ships, weapons and upgrades as you progress through the game</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Grav Factor is a built-for-VR game where you pilot a ship with 6DOF movement. Explore an underwater world to uncover its secrets, test your piloting skill in obstacle courses, and engage in both close-quarter and squad-based vehicular combat.",
